Subject: [PATCH] simple: cover every central gradient in VGA-size focus streams

Separate experimental decision candidate for the settled y7002 tree. Keep
the normal sparse scan above 640x480. At VGA the full grid contains
319 x 239 sites. All scoring thresholds and control timing are unchanged.

--- a/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/contrast_scan.cpp
+++ b/src/libcamera/pipeline/simple/contrast_scan.cpp
@@ -29,8 +29,9 @@
 		return {};
 
 	uint64_t energy = 0, light = 0, count = 0;
-	const unsigned int dx = std::max(1U, width / 192);
-	const unsigned int dy = std::max(1U, height / 144);
+	const bool fullGrid = width <= 640 && height <= 480;
+	const unsigned int dx = fullGrid ? 1 : std::max(1U, width / 192);
+	const unsigned int dy = fullGrid ? 1 : std::max(1U, height / 144);
 	for (unsigned int y = height / 4; y < height - height / 4 - 1; y += dy) {
 		for (unsigned int x = width / 4; x < width - width / 4 - 1; x += dx) {
 			const uint8_t *g = plane + size_t(y) * stride + size_t(x) * pixelBytes + 1;
